Now what *would* fail in some cases are apps that have something like:
```json
{
    "1": {
        "Uniswap": "0xabcd1234...",
        "Aave": "0xdeadbeef...",
    },
    "42": {
        "Uniswap": "0xcafebabe...",
        "Aave": "0xbaadf00d..."
    }
}
```but fixing those is easy, and on a brand new test network those won't work at all anyway, so it is at worst no loss.
